<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani cotton yarn rates close higher.</title>
<headline>Pakistani cotton yarn rates close higher.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistani cotton yarn rates closed higher on Wednesday on orders from foreign buyers, dealers said.</p>
<p>Rates were likely to rise in the next few days.</p>
<p>Following are the rates in rupees supplied by the Pakistan Yarn Merchants Association for 10-lb coneS of 21 counts:</p>
<p>Wednesday Dec 15</p>
<p>    Al-Karam		     510	   500</p>
<p>    Taj Textile		  510	   490</p>
<p>    Suraiya Textile	    500	   480</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
